1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,800
I'm your China Travel Expert.
我是你的中国旅游专家

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:04,200
Legend says this palace has 9,999 rooms.
传说它有9999间房

3
00:00:04,400 --> 00:00:06,400
The real number? About 8,700.
真相：约8700间

4
00:00:06,600 --> 00:00:08,800
It's the Forbidden City — 980 buildings.
紫禁城，980座殿宇

5
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:11,200
And it sits dead-center of Beijing.
正踩在北京城心上

6
00:00:11,400 --> 00:00:13,600
A 7.8-km line runs straight through it.
一条7.8公里中轴线

7
00:00:13,800 --> 00:00:16,000
That axis made World Heritage in 2024.
2024年入选世界遗产

8
00:00:16,200 --> 00:00:18,400
Double-tap if you'd walk the whole line.
想走完全程的点赞

9
00:00:18,600 --> 00:00:20,800
Emperors ruled here for nearly 500 years.
五百年，帝王在此

10
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:23,000
Every great hall lines up north to south.
殿殿正对，南北一线

11
00:00:23,200 --> 00:00:26,000
★ Expert Tip: enter at Meridian Gate, exit north — one straight walk down the axis.
内行提示：午门进，神武门出

12
00:00:26,200 --> 00:00:28,400
Next stop: the Bell & Drum Towers, where the axis ends.
下集：中轴终点钟鼓楼
